  "description": "This beach cruiser will make you want to pedal up and down the coast all day. Chatham Plus is an upgraded beach cruiser bike designed for relaxed, all-day rides by the coast. Its accessible step through frame makes hopping on and off a breeze, and its rust-resistant, lightweight aluminum build is perfect for that salty ocean air. Extra-wide tires deliver a super-smooth ride on boardwalks and beach paths, and lock-on grips keep your hands from slipping while you ride. This beach cruiser is built for the long haul, with aluminum components and stainless steel spokes that can go the extra mile. Whether you're cruising the beach, riding through town, or taking in the coastal sunset, this premium cruiser bike will add comfort and style to your easygoing adventures.",
